    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d837">

                <pb facs="0825" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg721"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/6250.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Huerta to the President.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 18, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have the honor to inform you that I have overthrown this Government. The forces
                    are with me, and from now on peace and prosperity will reign.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Victoriano Huerta</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
